Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:12.56,1:12:15.12,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a82f9c,Umputun,0,0,0,,А ELB, да, в курсе?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:12:15.14,1:12:16.14,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a82f9d,Umputun,0,0,0,,Elastic Load Balancer, да?
