Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:31.70,2:00:32.72,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832b9,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Понятно.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:32.76,2:00:34.46,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832ba,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Так и есть.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:34.78,2:00:35.78,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832bb,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:35.88,2:00:36.22,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832bc,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:36.30,2:00:37.52,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832bd,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Ну, что?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:37.56,2:00:38.52,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832be,SPEAKER_05,0,0,0,,Ага.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:38.58,2:00:39.80,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832bf,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Давайте того этого.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:39.84,2:00:40.63,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832c0,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Давайте этого.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:40.69,2:00:41.09,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832c1,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Блядь.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:41.15,2:00:42.15,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832c2,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Да.
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:00:42.21,2:00:44.21,65c9a0c5e45667ab16a832c3,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Я аж зевнул от неожиданности.
